-- ss 148-150: the 60-day preliminary assessment of a matter referred by the health ombudsman.
-- Received Thursday 5 March 2026: 26 days to 31 March, 30 in April, 4 in May: Monday 4 May 2026.
#ASSERT `By when must the Board assess my referred complaint question` (`the day` 5 3 2026) EQUALS `the day` 4 5 2026
-- Received Tuesday 3 March 2026: day 60 is Saturday 2 May; moved to Monday 4 May (Sch 7 cl 31(3)).
#ASSERT `By when must the Board assess my referred complaint question` (`the day` 3 3 2026) EQUALS `the day` 4 5 2026
-- Received Wednesday 4 March 2026: day 60 is Sunday 3 May; moved to Monday 4 May.
#ASSERT `By when must the Board assess my referred complaint question` (`the day` 4 3 2026) EQUALS `the day` 4 5 2026
-- Received Friday 31 December 2027: 31 days of January and 29 of February 2028 (a leap year): Tuesday 29 February 2028.
#ASSERT `By when must the Board assess my referred complaint question` (`the day` 31 12 2027) EQUALS `the day` 29 2 2028
-- In time on the last day; late the day after.
#ASSERT `Was my referred complaint assessed in time question` (`the day` 5 3 2026) (`the day` 4 5 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`Was my referred complaint assessed in time question` (`the day` 5 3 2026) (`the day` 5 5 2026))
#ASSERT `Was my referred complaint assessed in time question` (`the day` 3 3 2026) (`the day` 4 5 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`Was my referred complaint assessed in time question` (`the day` 2 3 2026) (`the day` 4 5 2026))

-- The s 150 rule. Received 5 March 2026: 60 days. Received 3 March 2026: 62 days (to Monday 4 May).
`assessed on day 60` MEANS
    CONSIDER EVALTRACE (`the s 150 assessment duty for a matter received on` (`the day` 5 3 2026)) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the National Board` `conduct the preliminary assessment of the referred matter (s 150(1))` 60))
    WHEN FULFILLED THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE
#ASSERT `assessed on day 60` EQUALS TRUE
`assessed on day 61` MEANS
    CONSIDER EVALTRACE (`the s 150 assessment duty for a matter received on` (`the day` 5 3 2026)) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the National Board` `conduct the preliminary assessment of the referred matter (s 150(1))` 61))
    WHEN FULFILLED THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE
#ASSERT `assessed on day 61` EQUALS FALSE
`assessed on day 62 after a weekend` MEANS
    CONSIDER EVALTRACE (`the s 150 assessment duty for a matter received on` (`the day` 3 3 2026)) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the National Board` `conduct the preliminary assessment of the referred matter (s 150(1))` 62))
    WHEN FULFILLED THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE
#ASSERT `assessed on day 62 after a weekend` EQUALS TRUE
`assessed on day 63 after a weekend` MEANS
    CONSIDER EVALTRACE (`the s 150 assessment duty for a matter received on` (`the day` 3 3 2026)) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the National Board` `conduct the preliminary assessment of the referred matter (s 150(1))` 63))
    WHEN FULFILLED THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE
#ASSERT `assessed on day 63 after a weekend` EQUALS FALSE

